.el .ds Aq '
.TH ifg-version 1  "ifg-version 0.8.1" 
.SH NAME
ifg\-version \- Print the client version and (when reachable) the server version
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBifg version\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the client version and (when reachable) the server version
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH VERSION
v0.8.1
